   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project funding, Voices of Change</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Voices of Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projektet g&#xe5;r ut p&#xe5; att intervjua framg&#xe5;ngsrika kvinnor i Etiopien och g&#xf6;ra radioinslag av det f&#xf6;r att visa etiopiska kvinnor att det g&#xe5;r att g&#xf6;ra karri&#xe4;r som kvinna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Voice of Change is a proposed radio series consisting of 5 interviews, broadcasted on an award-winning radio show in Ethiopia. The interviewees will be notable women within the business/social sectors, who will tell their stories of change and their experiences challenging gender norms and inequalities. With this radio show, we intend to 1) inspire listening women/girls in both rural and urban areas of Ethiopia, 2) empower them into believing that a business/social entrepreneurship career could be for them,
and 3) increase awareness of relevant opportunities and pathways for realising those goals.</narrative>
  </description>
